WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.475
Every home kitchen hears the same question,

00:00:03.495 --> 00:00:04.795
every single night.

00:00:04.815 --> 00:00:06.971
What's for dinner?

00:00:08.577 --> 00:00:09.322
In our kitchen,

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:13.606
the answer started as a list that was curated over years of scouring recipes online,

00:00:13.626 --> 00:00:14.983
flipping through cookbooks,

00:00:15.003 --> 00:00:16.861
and saving family favorites.

00:00:16.881 --> 00:00:18.479
Every recipe worth making twice,

00:00:18.499 --> 00:00:19.591
cooked for the family,

00:00:19.611 --> 00:00:21.658
and tweaked until it was right.

00:00:21.678 --> 00:00:22.710
Pad Thai. Bolognese.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:23.604
Chicken Shawarma.

00:00:23.624 --> 00:00:25.101
French Onion Soup.

00:00:25.121 --> 00:00:26.886
The list kept growing... and growing...

00:00:26.906 --> 00:00:28.055
and growing.

00:00:29.346 --> 00:00:32.387
But a static list can't tell you what you should cook tonight.

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.918
Sometimes you need inspiration.

00:00:33.938 --> 00:00:37.577
Sometimes you need to know what you can make with what you have.

00:00:37.597 --> 00:00:40.060
And if you have something special you want to cook,

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.822
you need to easily know what you're missing.

00:00:44.196 --> 00:00:45.499
So our list got an upgrade.

00:00:45.519 --> 00:00:47.172
A whole website of its own.

00:00:47.192 --> 00:00:48.642
One part food. One part humor.

00:00:48.662 --> 00:00:50.902
All of it built for feeding the family.

00:00:50.922 --> 00:00:53.255
This is Down With Hunger.

00:00:55.885 --> 00:00:56.834
Every dish is here.

00:00:56.854 --> 00:00:58.416
Cuisines from around the world,

00:00:58.436 --> 00:01:01.163
everything from breads to entrees to desserts.

00:01:01.183 --> 00:01:03.536
Browse the whole collection, filter by cuisine,

00:01:03.556 --> 00:01:05.809
see every vegan option, browse holiday menus,

00:01:05.829 --> 00:01:08.077
or get inspired and spin the globe.

00:01:08.097 --> 00:01:09.522
Got chicken thighs to use up?

00:01:09.542 --> 00:01:12.884
Search the ingredient and see every dish that stars it.

00:01:14.346 --> 00:01:15.235
Behind the scenes,

00:01:15.255 --> 00:01:17.553
the staples are already accounted for.

00:01:17.573 --> 00:01:19.061
Spices, sauces, rice, noodles,

00:01:19.081 --> 00:01:21.223
and the proteins that are always available.

00:01:21.243 --> 00:01:23.134
More than two hundred and fifty items,

00:01:23.154 --> 00:01:24.790
loaded in ahead of time.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.435
So the site already knows what's on hand.

00:01:29.346 --> 00:01:30.525
Making a meal on the fly?

00:01:30.545 --> 00:01:32.079
Open, What can I make?

00:01:32.099 --> 00:01:33.571
Add anything extra you've got.

00:01:33.591 --> 00:01:35.682
Say, a can of pineapple juice.

00:01:36.682 --> 00:01:38.410
Teriyaki Chicken just made the cut.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.907
Everything you can cook right now goes to the top,

00:01:40.927 --> 00:01:44.403
and the near misses tell you exactly what they're missing.

00:01:44.423 --> 00:01:46.035
Just visiting? No account needed.

00:01:46.055 --> 00:01:47.123
Type in what you have,

00:01:47.143 --> 00:01:49.029
and it works the same way.

00:01:50.115 --> 00:01:52.247
Planning a quick shopping trip for one dish?

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:54.970
Open the recipe, and flip, Can I cook this?

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:56.746
What you have turns green.

00:01:56.766 --> 00:01:58.561
What you need turns red.

00:01:58.861 --> 00:02:01.070
Shopping list: done.

00:02:02.808 --> 00:02:04.966
And when nobody can decide, hit Surprise me,

00:02:04.986 --> 00:02:07.022
and let the reel pick dinner.

00:02:12.338 --> 00:02:14.981
Every dish worth cooking, one click away.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.962
Down with hunger.
